#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Test tools/ship's test generator and its runner.

    tools/testdata/ship-selftest              the generator, then the ship
    tools/testdata/ship-selftest --no-ship    the generator only
    tools/testdata/ship-selftest --many 300   also run 300 made-up cases

The generator checks need no ship: tools/ship gen-tests on no cases, on
the cases in tools/testdata/ship-golden, on cases whose names clash or
aren't knots, and on a few hundred made-up cases, and --check.

The ship checks run tools/ship test --stub --golden on the running fake
ship: the cases in tools/testdata/ship-golden, whose about.txt files
end with what each should give ("Expected: OK", or FAILED or CRASHED,
with words the failure must print), then a library that doesn't build,
and with --many, that many made-up cases that all pass.  They leave the
jibb-dev desk holding the last run's files; tools/ship test puts back
the real ones.

Exit status: 0 when every check passes, 1 otherwise.
"""

